## Development Pipeline (shipwright)

```
/shipwright:design <requirement | TICKET-ID>   → SDD + adversarial hardening
/shipwright:breakdown <sdd-path>               → tasks (+ Jira); reply "approved" to unlock code
(implement)                                    → sdd-implementer runs the bug loop
/shipwright:retro                              → capture learnings
/shipwright:ship <env>                         → docs → tests → types → review → build → Jira
/shipwright:dashboard                          → visual pipeline state (read-only)
/shipwright:resume | :checkpoint | :remember   → continue, save/clear, write a memory
/shipwright:doctor                             → installation health check
```

Commit messages reference the task (`T<id>`) or Jira key.

